<p>This is a complete mindf*** and I love it. The format/layout of this makes the reader explore and discover more about this SCP. It's a unique entity. Even when you think you have it figured out, you're proven wrong to the point where you have to accept your complete lack of understanding of SCP-3463. Even the very end has me questioning if its correct or not, and leaves me to wonder about it. It makes a connection to the reader, as the supposed effects pertain to reading it. Lastly, this entity is a pure Keter. There is no hope of completely containing it, or at all. Its very <em>existence</em> poses a threat.</p>
<p>Overall, it's incredibly well done.</p>
<p>+1</p>

